OL,3,AMasts from explosives-packed ship taken
OL,4,Ato museum
OL,5,
OL,6,FJunior transport minister, Kier Mather
OL,7,Fsaid removing the masts had reduced the
OL,8,Frisk of them toppling on to and
OL,9,Fdetonating the bombs.
